        "definition": "CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.guard_exercise_substitution_version()\n RETURNS trigger\n LANGUAGE plpgsql\n SET search_path TO ''\nAS $function$ begin if new.updated_at < old.updated_at or (new.updated_at = old.updated_at and new.replacement is distinct from old.replacement) then return old; end if; return new; end; $function$\n",
